  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced MavLinkContext to support multiple MAVLink dialects simultaneously in the same application.\n\t\t\t- Added high-performance typed accessors to the Frame class (e.g., GetByte, GetUInt32, GetArray<T>) to eliminate boxing and dictionary overhead.\n\t\t\t- Optimized field lookups with a new FieldsByName dictionary in the Message class for O(1) access.\n\t\t\t- Added Frame.TryWriteBytes for efficient, zero-allocation packet serialization to an existing buffer.\n\t\t\t- Refactored internal metadata management to be instance-based while maintaining backward compatibility via the Default context.",
